    "optimizedContext": {
      "value": "# ResolveChangeSchema\n## Rules\n- Lookup `SchemaProvider.get(schemaName)` from recorded change reference; return schema plus warnings.\n- Exact canonical-name mismatch throws `SchemaProviderIdentityMismatchError`.\n- Same-name version mismatch warns only; propagate other failures.\n- Shared boundary for change-schema consumers; factory resolves canonical deps.\n## Constraints\n- Never use workspace default, mutate change, or persist warnings.",
